{"id":"d384d77e035108ca","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-split-replacement.md","title":"纤维化的明确分裂替代","display":"thm-split-replacement — 纤维化的明确分裂替代","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"5","label":"16-thm-split-replacement","aliases":["16-thm-split-replacement","16-thm-reflective-chain","Split replacement of a fibration","16-thm--reflective-chain"],"display":"thm-split-replacement — 纤维化的明确分裂替代","depends_on":["[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-slice-category]]","[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]"],"review_status":"resolved-by-source-correction","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J13","review_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"source-checked-and-local-proof","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_review":"Theorem 1.10.7 pp. 110–111 (PDF 130–131); Proposition 1.10.9 p. 112 (PDF 132); Corollary 5.2.5 p. 324 (PDF 344)","source":"Lemma 5.2.4 and Corollary 5.2.5, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344); construction and equivalence expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-split-replacement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-split-replacement</span><span>16-thm-reflective-chain</span><span>Split replacement of a fibration</span><span>16-thm--reflective-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-split-replacement — 纤维化的明确分裂替代"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-by-source-correction"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J13"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-checked-and-local-proof"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_review","html":"Theorem 1.10.7 pp. 110–111 (PDF 130–131); Proposition 1.10.9 p. 112 (PDF 132); Corollary 5.2.5 p. 324 (PDF 344)"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 5.2.4 and Corollary 5.2.5, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344); construction and equivalence expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B\\)</span> 在宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中小，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W\\)</span>。函子与自然变换范畴在较大宇宙中编码；元理论采用足以为此小箭头族选择笛卡尔提升的选择公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\\)</span>；函子的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 分别表示对象函数与箭头函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定该选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_!:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B/J\">\\(u_!:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B/J\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\">\\(\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatIso}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a>。自然变换族的恒等与复合逐分量按下文构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_I,R_p,p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p},Q_p\">\\(\\mathcal A_I,R_p,p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p},Q_p\\)</span> 为下文构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K,L\">\\(H,K,L\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_I\">\\(\\mathcal A_I\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K\">\\(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:K\\Rightarrow L\">\\(\\beta:K\\Rightarrow L\\)</span> 为其候选垂直自然变换；总箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K u_!\">\\(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K u_!\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>候选变换的分量族均以对应切片范畴的对象集为索引；每个分量已有集合值。其箭头型属、自然性与垂直性在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_I\">\\(M_I\\)</span> 的定义中检验。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_p(u)\">\\(R_p(u)\\)</span> 的对象及箭头公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A_J\">\\(H,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A_J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_J(H,K)\">\\(\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_J(H,K)\\)</span>；该段使用这些源纤维参数。末段中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的全部量化域由公式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid H,K\\in O_I\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\prod_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\mathcal E(Ha,Ka)\n\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K)\\},\\\\\ns_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq H,\n\\qquad t_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq K,\\\\\ne_I(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,H,(\\operatorname{id}_{H(a)})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_I(\\langle K,L,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,L,(\\beta_a\\alpha_a)_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_I,M_I,s_I,t_I,e_I,c_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal A_I)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid H,K\\in O_I\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\prod_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\mathcal E(Ha,Ka)\n\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K)\\},\\\\\ns_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq H,\n\\qquad t_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq K,\\\\\ne_I(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,H,(\\operatorname{id}_{H(a)})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_I(\\langle K,L,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,L,(\\beta_a\\alpha_a)_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_I,M_I,s_I,t_I,e_I,c_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal A_I)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_p(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_I,\\\\\nR_p(u)_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H u_!,\\\\\nR_p(u)_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H u_!,K u_!,\n(\\alpha_{ua})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_p(u)_0,R_p(u)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B},(R_p(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B}\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(R_p,\\mathcal B),\\\\\np_{R_p}:\\textstyle\\int R_p\\to\\mathcal B&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_p(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_I,\\\\\nR_p(u)_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H u_!,\\\\\nR_p(u)_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H u_!,K u_!,\n(\\alpha_{ua})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_p(u)_0,R_p(u)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B},(R_p(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B}\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(R_p,\\mathcal B),\\\\\np_{R_p}:\\textstyle\\int R_p\\to\\mathcal B&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_u&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_J,u\\rangle\n\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal B/J)\\quad(u:I\\to J),\\\\\nQ_{p,0}(I,H)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\operatorname{id}_I),\\\\\nQ_{p,1}\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq K(\\delta_u)\\circ\\alpha_{\\operatorname{id}_I},\\\\\nQ_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q_{p,0},Q_{p,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(Q_p;p_{R_p},p)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_u&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_J,u\\rangle\n\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal B/J)\\quad(u:I\\to J),\\\\\nQ_{p,0}(I,H)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\operatorname{id}_I),\\\\\nQ_{p,1}\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq K(\\delta_u)\\circ\\alpha_{\\operatorname{id}_I},\\\\\nQ_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q_{p,0},Q_{p,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(Q_p;p_{R_p},p)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists S\\in\\{T\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal E,\\textstyle\\int R_p)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(T;p,p_{R_p})\\})&amp;\\\\\n\\left(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\prod_{Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int R_p)}(\\textstyle\\int R_p)(S(Q_pZ),Z)\\right)&amp;\n\\left(\\exists\\tau\\in\\prod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\mathcal E(Q_p(SX),X)\\right)\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\int R_p,\\int R_p}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal E}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists S\\in\\{T\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal E,\\textstyle\\int R_p)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(T;p,p_{R_p})\\})&amp;\\\\\n\\left(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\prod_{Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int R_p)}(\\textstyle\\int R_p)(S(Q_pZ),Z)\\right)&amp;\n\\left(\\exists\\tau\\in\\prod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\mathcal E(Q_p(SX),X)\\right)\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\int R_p,\\int R_p}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal E}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_I\">\\(\\mathcal A_I\\)</span> 是原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\)</span>：对象为纤维函子，箭头为垂直自然变换，不能只取对象集合。恒等与复合保留自然性和垂直性，故该范畴良定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_!\">\\(u_!\\)</span> 严格保持恒等、复合，且切片中每个箭头均笛卡尔；预复合给出严格索引范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_p\">\\(R_p\\)</span>。因此 Grothendieck 构造产生指定分裂，完全不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 自身已经分裂。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_p\">\\(Q_p\\)</span> 的箭头公式取垂直分量后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 对切片箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\to\\operatorname{id}_J\">\\(u\\to\\operatorname{id}_J\\)</span> 的像，故位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 之上。自然性和切片复合给出函子性；所选总提升被映为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\delta_u)\">\\(K(\\delta_u)\\)</span>，是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-笛卡尔箭头。</li>\n<li>对任意位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:H(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\to K(\\operatorname{id}_J)\">\\(h:H(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\to K(\\operatorname{id}_J)\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:T\\to I\">\\(a:T\\to I\\)</span> 上的分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_a:H(a)\\to K(ua)\">\\(\\alpha_a:H(a)\\to K(ua)\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\delta_{ua})\\alpha_a=h H(\\delta_a)\">\\(K(\\delta_{ua})\\alpha_a=h H(\\delta_a)\\)</span> 唯一确定，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\delta_{ua})\">\\(K(\\delta_{ua})\\)</span> 笛卡尔。唯一性证明这些分量自然、垂直并恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_p\">\\(Q_p\\)</span> 在每一 Hom 上双射。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>，选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 给出纤维函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_X(a)=a^*X\">\\(H_X(a)=a^*X\\)</span>，其切片箭头由提升唯一因子确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_X(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\cong X\">\\(H_X(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\cong X\\)</span> 的同构垂直，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_p\">\\(Q_p\\)</span> 在每个纤维本质满。以上满忠实性与逐纤维本质满性允许在同一基对象上选择逆像并唯一提升箭头，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 及两个垂直自然同构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 反映到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_p\">\\(Q_p\\)</span> 后保持笛卡尔泛性质，所以也是纤维函子。这同时给出原书 fibred Yoneda 证明的展开。</li>\n<li>历史纠正 J13：旧断言含三个未定义的 2-范畴及两个所谓 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>-反射伴随，并声称其 unit 给出双等价。已核对的 Theorem 1.10.7、Proposition 1.10.9 和 Corollary 5.2.5 未支持该双重反射链。本页恢复与其“分裂化”意图相符且有明确来源、构造及等价数据的 Corollary 5.2.5；不再保留旧链为有效断言，也未将该链标为已证明。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Lemma 5.2.4、Corollary 5.2.5, pp. 323–324（PDF 343–344）。固定基范畴的 split/indexed 对应另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"3af0cd796b55bbd7\" href=\"?note=3af0cd796b55bbd7\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration-category\">16-df-split-fibration-category</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定该选择 $\\kappa$，满足 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$。$\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B$ 与 $u_!:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B/J$ 采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定该选择 $\\kappa$，满足 [[16-df-cleavage]] 的 $\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$。$\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B$ 与 $u_!:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B/J$ 采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{VerticalNat}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]；$\\operatorname{Fun}$、$\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。自然变换族的恒等与复合逐分量按下文构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{VerticalNat}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-functor]]；$\\operatorname{Fun}$、$\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。自然变换族的恒等与复合逐分量按下文构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration-category","status":"resolved","id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, Lemma 5.2.4、Corollary 5.2.5, pp. 323–324（PDF 343–344）。固定基范畴的 split/indexed 对应另见 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\in\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u_!:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B/J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatIso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_I,R_p,p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p},Q_p","display":false},{"tex":"H,K,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:K\\Rightarrow L","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K u_!","display":false},{"tex":"M_I","display":false},{"tex":"R_p(u)","display":false},{"tex":"H,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_J(H,K)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_I&\\coloneqq\\{H\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal E)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\},\\\\\nM_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid H,K\\in O_I\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\prod_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\mathcal E(Ha,Ka)\n\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K)\\},\\\\\ns_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle&\\coloneqq H,\n\\qquad t_I\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq K,\\\\\ne_I(H)&\\coloneqq\\langle H,H,(\\operatorname{id}_{H(a)})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_I(\\langle K,L,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle H,L,(\\beta_a\\alpha_a)_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A_I&\\coloneqq\\langle O_I,M_I,s_I,t_I,e_I,c_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal A_I)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_p(I)&\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_I,\\\\\nR_p(u)_0(H)&\\coloneqq H u_!,\\\\\nR_p(u)_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle H u_!,K u_!,\n(\\alpha_{ua})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p(u)&\\coloneqq\\langle R_p(u)_0,R_p(u)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nR_p&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B},(R_p(u))_{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B}\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(R_p,\\mathcal B),\\\\\np_{R_p}:\\textstyle\\int R_p\\to\\mathcal B&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p_{R_p},\\kappa_{R_p}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_u&\\coloneqq\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_J,u\\rangle\n\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal B/J)\\quad(u:I\\to J),\\\\\nQ_{p,0}(I,H)&\\coloneqq H(\\operatorname{id}_I),\\\\\nQ_{p,1}\\langle(I,H),(J,K),u,\\langle H,Ku_!,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq K(\\delta_u)\\circ\\alpha_{\\operatorname{id}_I},\\\\\nQ_p&\\coloneqq\\langle Q_{p,0},Q_{p,1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(Q_p;p_{R_p},p)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\exists S\\in\\{T\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal E,\\textstyle\\int R_p)\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(T;p,p_{R_p})\\})&\\\\\n\\left(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\prod_{Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int R_p)}(\\textstyle\\int R_p)(S(Q_pZ),Z)\\right)&\n\\left(\\exists\\tau\\in\\prod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\mathcal E(Q_p(SX),X)\\right)\\bigl[\\\\\n&\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\int R_p,\\int R_p}(\\sigma:SQ_p\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\int R_p})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\n\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal E}(\\tau:Q_pS\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)","display":false},{"tex":"u_!","display":false},{"tex":"R_p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"Q_p","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"u\\to\\operatorname{id}_J","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\delta_u)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"h:H(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\to K(\\operatorname{id}_J)","display":false},{"tex":"a:T\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_a:H(a)\\to K(ua)","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\delta_{ua})\\alpha_a=h H(\\delta_a)","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\delta_{ua})","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"Q_p","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"H_X(a)=a^*X","display":false},{"tex":"H_X(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\cong X","display":false},{"tex":"Q_p","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"Q_p","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false}],"bytes":7462,"backlinks":[{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是原书 Theorem 1.10.7 在固定基范畴上的普通范畴等价。没有由此推出“严格、分裂、一般纤维化”的两个包含都是 2-反射；一般纤维化的分裂替代见 [[16-thm-split-replacement]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]、[[16-df-unique-choice]]、[[16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal]]、[[16-thm-sub-characterization]]、[[16-thm-split-replacement]]。分裂替代采用与其断言一致的文件名；其结论是纤维等价与指定分裂的构造。"}],"outgoing":["eb3d8d8bfc151af6","fc49efccd7348d66","25a281534aa42440","0cd12b341f6289c0","afc1fb30a05f3662","43c81e33a22655f0","25140205ca0312de","4ea27d39c2af987b","3af0cd796b55bbd7"]}